{"id":"434002","name":"泡菜排骨海参面","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/434002/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"熟排骨","amount":"适量（及汤）"},{"name":"面条","amount":"120克左右"},{"name":"海参","amount":"2个"},{"name":"泡菜","amount":"80克"},{"name":"食盐","amount":"0.5克"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"小许"},{"name":"清水","amount":"50克（排骨汤）"}],"sub":[{"name":"清水","amount":"若干（煮面）"},{"name":"青小米辣","amount":"一个"},{"name":"红小米辣","amount":"一个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"泡发好的海参。","img":"images/434002/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"排骨。","img":"images/434002/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"泡萝卜，泡豆角，泡姜块都冲洗一下。","img":"images/434002/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"泡菜和葱改刀。","img":"images/434002/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"热锅冷油。","img":"images/434002/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"油热倒入泡菜和葱花翻炒。","img":"images/434002/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放食盐。","img":"images/434002/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"炒均匀就倒入排骨。","img":"images/434002/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加点清水，放海参。","img":"images/434002/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"中火烧开，炖一会，等煮好的面条。","img":"images/434002/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"关火。","img":"images/434002/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"取龙须面。","img":"images/434002/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"煮2开即可。","img":"images/434002/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"捞出。","img":"images/434002/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放汤锅里，开大火。","img":"images/434002/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"洗好的小米辣。","img":"images/434002/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"切圈。","img":"images/434002/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"煮开的面条里放上辣椒圈，关火。","img":"images/434002/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"捞出面条装碗底。","img":"images/434002/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"盛上泡菜排骨和海参，倒上汤汁即可。","img":"images/434002/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/434002/step_21.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}